JBIG2Bitmap::expand() grows a striped page of unknown height to the bottom
row of each immediate region, which comes from the stream (up to ~2 GB).
The constructor soft-fails when its allocation fails, expand() used
grealloc() and aborted. Fail the same way (data = nullptr; the callers
check isOk()).

